---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---

<figure class="diagram">
    <div class="diagram-scroll">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 520 420" role="img" aria-labelledby="relax-title relax-desc">
            <title id="relax-title">Zero-results relaxation cascade</title>
            <desc id="relax-desc">
                Six levels, L0 exact through L5 fallback. The engine stops at the first level that returns enough hits.
                Stricter levels rank above looser ones. Filters are not relaxed unless the caller opts in.
            </desc>
            <rect width="520" height="420" fill="#ffffff" />
            <g font-family="Courier New, Courier, monospace" font-size="13" fill="#000000">
                <rect x="16" y="16" width="150" height="70" fill="#c0c0c0" stroke="#000080" stroke-width="2" />
                <text x="28" y="42">L0 exact</text>
                <text x="28" y="64">every term required</text>

                <rect x="184" y="16" width="150" height="70" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#000080" stroke-width="2" />
                <text x="196" y="42">L1 synonyms</text>
                <text x="196" y="64">expand groups</text>

                <rect x="352" y="16" width="152" height="70" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#000080" stroke-width="2" />
                <text x="364" y="42">L2 drop terms</text>
                <text x="364" y="64">100, 75, 50, 1</text>

                <rect x="16" y="120" width="150" height="70" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#000080" stroke-width="2" />
                <text x="28" y="146">L3 prefix</text>
                <text x="28" y="168">capped expansions</text>

                <rect x="184" y="120" width="150" height="70" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#000080" stroke-width="2" />
                <text x="196" y="146">L4 fuzzy</text>
                <text x="196" y="168">edit distance 1 or 2</text>

                <rect x="352" y="120" width="152" height="70" fill="#ffffcc" stroke="#800000" stroke-width="2" />
                <text x="364" y="146">L5 fallback</text>
                <text x="364" y="168">static rank, or none</text>

                <text x="16" y="230">Stop at the first level with enough hits (default: one).</text>
                <text x="16" y="254">A stricter level always ranks above a looser one.</text>
                <text x="16" y="278">The response includes level, applied steps, and corrections.</text>
                <text x="16" y="302">Filters stay as written, unless relax.filters is last_resort.</text>
                <text x="16" y="326">A time budget (default 50 ms) returns the best so far.</text>
                <text x="16" y="350">Turn the whole feature off per query with relax: false.</text>
                <text x="16" y="386">Planned. SPEC section 7.6. Milestone M8. On by default in the design.</text>
                <text x="16" y="410">L5 is drawn on a yellow field so the last resort is easy to find; the label says fallback.</text>
            </g>
        </svg>
    </div>
    <figcaption>
        The cascade in SPEC §7.6. The full table, with the illustrative JSON shape, is in the
        <a href={`${base}/guide/features/#zero-results-relaxation`}>features guide</a>.
    </figcaption>
</figure>
